    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not really \"severe\" breathing difficulty, it's more like I just get winded quickly when I move around. and the leg is just tight, nothing crazy. i'm really trying to avoid the hospital because the wait times in london are insane right now and i'm just exhausted. are you sure i shouldn't just take a heavy dose of ibuprofen and some aspirin to thin the blood a bit and just rest for a day or two? would that be enough to handle it?",
